  "description": "Home Club Ltd are delighted to present this recently renovated two-bedroom apartment to the rental market. The accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hall, two spacious double bedrooms, family bathroom, large hot-press providing excellent storage, and a bright, open-plan kitchen and living area. The property benefits from gas heating and is ideally located for public transport, with the Luas approximately 500 metres away and Heuston Station within walking distance.\n\nKey Features:\nRecently renovated\nTwo bedrooms\nBright open-plan kitchen/living room\nFamily bathroom\nLarge hot-press/storage area\nGas heating\nLuas approximately 500m away\nHeuston Station within walking distance\nStrictly no smoking\nNo pets permitted\nThere is no parking with this unit!",
